  "dry_snp_activity": "On the Panamax sector, Greek buyers acquired the “Xing Ji Hai” - 77K/2009 Oshima for USD 17.8 mills, while on the same sector the “Nefeli” - 77K/2004 Sa- sebo was sold for USD 11.2 mills. On the Supramax sector, the “NZ Hangzhou” - 57K/2012 Qingshan was sold for mid/high USD 14 mills to Greek buyers. Final- ly, on the Handysize sector, the “New Legend Pearl”- 33K/2010 JNS found new owners for USD 10.2 mills, while the “Katya Atk” - 28K/2009 Imabari changed hands for USD 9 mills basis BWTS due September 2024.\n\nNAME DWT YEAR COUNTRY YARD BUYERS PRICE ($ mills) COMMENTS",
